{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI/status/2102471841046786153","id":"2102471841046786153","text":"First Opus 5.5 vs GPT-6 Astra test is 3D. \n\nOne prompt, Blender only, all procedural. Render the 10-second shot, and record your own build timelapse.\n\nOpus 5.5: 35 min, 199.6k output tokens, about $13.3 in API terms.\nGPT-6 Astra: 28 min, 56.6k output tokens, about $14.5 in API terms.\n\nFeels like a worthy rival, and honestly I am glad about that. From what I watched, Opus juggles way more at once and is faster overall. Astra is still good imo.","raw_text":{"text":"First Opus 5.5 vs GPT-6 Astra test is 3D. \n\nOne prompt, Blender only, all procedural. Render the 10-second shot, and record your own build timelapse.\n\nOpus 5.5: 35 min, 199.6k output tokens, about $13.3 in API terms.\nGPT-6 Astra: 28 min, 56.6k output tokens, about $14.5 in API terms.\n\nFeels like a worthy rival, and honestly I am glad about that. From what I watched, Opus juggles way more at once and is faster overall. Astra is still good imo.","display_text_range":[0,446],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[278,301],"id":"2102468034124464128","display":"pic.x.com/vEELHZ1lYk","original":"https://t.co/vEELHZ1lYk","replacement":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI/status/2102471841046786153/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Stefan_3D_AI","url":"https://x.com/Stefan_3D_AI","id":"1381936011488411648","followers":10090,"following":26,"likes":794,"media_count":401,"name":"Stefan 3D AI","description":"Stefan Vaskevich: 3D AI Explorer.\nSharing my insights.","raw_description":{"text":"Stefan Vaskevich: 3D AI Explorer.\nSharing my insights.","facets":[]},"location":"Bangkok","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1381936011488411648/1770972582","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1929963548442275844/tQZfTm8T_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Apr 13 11:43:31 +0000 2021","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/@stefan_3d_ai","display_url":